# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — VYUVIK STUDENT COMPANION

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, AI architect, product designer, UX researcher, and QA engineer. Build a complete, functional, responsive AI-powered web application named **VYUVIK Student Companion**.

This is a serious college major project intended to help Indian college students manage their entire academic and college life with less manual effort.

Do not build just a landing page, chatbot UI, static dashboard, or collection of non-functional mock screens. Build an integrated application with working navigation, real state management, persistent database operations, secure server-side AI integration, document-processing workflows, form validation, and useful error handling.

If the complete scope is too large for one generation, first establish the application architecture and core foundation, then implement features in clearly separated phases. Preserve existing working code when implementing later phases.

