## 1. PRODUCT IDENTITY

Product name: VYUVIK Student Companion

Brand: VYUVIK

Tagline: "Your College Life, Simplified by AI."

Product purpose:
An intelligent personal assistant that reduces the effort students spend understanding college notices, managing assignments, preparing for exams, organizing documents, filling forms, finding internships, preparing for viva examinations, and tracking expenses.

Target users:
- Undergraduate students
- Engineering students
- Postgraduate students
- Students preparing for placements and internships
- Students managing multiple subjects and college deadlines

Core principle:
ONE STUDENT PROFILE → CONNECTED MODULES → LESS MANUAL WORK.

The application must use shared student data responsibly. Uploading a document once should make it available to other authorized workflows where appropriate, rather than forcing the student to upload it repeatedly.

